(not really a spoiler but some people might thing so)























	There is a 1/3 chance that a bones file will be created, and a
1/10 chance that a subsequent characture will use a bones level, instead
of randomly generating one.  What it is, is not a way to continue
playing; it saves the level you're on when you die, along with all the
nasties, your corpse and ghost, etc, just as you left it, so another
character can get any of your especially nifty items.  Be warned,
they'll be cursed.

